# The Inferno for replays: map region 9043 (RuneLite's TimersAndBuffsPlugin.INFERNO_REGION_ID and
# DiscordGameEventType.MG_INFERNO), south-west corner 2240,5312. Schematic: an open floor at the
# region's template tiles, where the plugin maps the instance back to; no pillars or walls.
# "There are 69 waves in total." (oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/The_Inferno)

scene 2220 5292
skill HITPOINTS 99
skill PRAYER 99
at 2270 5340
login

watch open arenas.openArena
watch infernoRuns arenas.log.inferno.runs.size
watch reached arenas.log.inferno.active.reached
watch cleared arenas.log.inferno.active.cleared
watch splits arenas.log.inferno.active.splits
watch paused arenas.log.inferno.paused
watch caveRun book.active
